[h1]Custom-Fonts[/h1]

A fork of Custom Fonts by nmkj_yuri.

This mod enables changing the game font to system fonts or bundled ones.
ゲームのフォントをOSのフォントか同梱フォントに変更できるようにします。
게임 폰트를 시스템 폰트나 번들된 폰트로 변경할 수 있습니다.

[h2]Original[/h2]

author : nmkj
url: https://github.com/nmkj-io/rw-customfonts

[h2]Added Features[/h2]

[list]
  [*]better save file dialog
  [*]Steam Deck Patch (etc)
  [*]custom font per size
  [*]font search
  [*]1.5 Support
[/list]

[h2]Steam Deck (Steam Linux Runtime) host font patch[/h2]

Allows the use of host fonts in certain environments. This is an experimental feature.

  /usr/share/fonts <-> /run/host/fonts/

[h2]Bundled Fonts[/h2]

[list]
  [*]Sarasa UI J Regular v1.0.42 — Japanese regional glyph forms
  [*]Sarasa UI K Regular v1.0.42 — Korean regional glyph forms
[/list]

Both fonts use SIL Open Font License 1.1 and support Chinese, Japanese and Korean.
Rare ideograph coverage is partial. Copyright notices and the complete license are
included in About/FontLicenses/; the mod's MIT license does not replace the font license.
[url=https://github.com/be5invis/Sarasa-Gothic/releases/tag/v1.0.42]Official release[/url]
